  - {fileID: 1388331310783289699}
  lanes:
  - {fileID: 3783927074120145611}
  - {fileID: 4815468541929614603}
  - {fileID: 6556823571940934557}
  - {fileID: 7505260674325763371}
  tools:
  - {fileID: 6731634169209797648}
  - {fileID: 6182045689690197715}
  - {fileID: 5284108986776049278}
  speech:
  - clip: {fileID: 8300000, guid: b78c9834317ac4e65a6555ff707401ef, type: 3}
    text: Inspect this Class A training plate. Grip the inspection lamp, then hold the trigger and aim at the plate.
  - clip: {fileID: 8300000, guid: 3ebf08ff2cd8a49a9b473ad462caa03e, type: 3}
    text: Inspect the plate with the lamp before choosing a wipe.
  - clip: {fileID: 8300000, guid: 50960e9da9a244a0d97375d9fa3e25ab, type: 3}
    text: KIMTECH W4 is not suitable for Class A. Choose Anticon Gold polyester.
  - clip: {fileID: 8300000, guid: 796b11ef4aeda471289945c5d9af7998, type: 3}
    text: Anticon Gold is intended for Class A; the client does not recommend it for Class B. Choose KIMTECH W4 here.
  - clip: {fileID: 8300000, guid: 8c606d52206a0467b8406387efeacf64, type: 3}
    text: Use four parallel, slightly overlapping passes. Pull from left to right and lift at each end. Use a fresh face for each pass.
  - clip: {fileID: 8300000, guid: 6b03ba7d21d0f478e9de7ec6036f7722, type: 3}
    text: Lift the wipe off the plate before changing its face.
  - clip: {fileID: 8300000, guid: e0cfd34c2f6094c5dbb5516c8aa36f6d, type: 3}
    text: Refolded to a fresh face. Make the third pass.
  - clip: {fileID: 8300000, guid: f779ef4a8ee0d4e80b8284fdcfece8ca, type: 3}
    text: Flipped to a fresh face. Make the next pass.
  - clip: {fileID: 8300000, guid: c22a3c0cce9364fc281b59cddd5e95c3, type: 3}
    text: Four passes completed. Visible particles are reduced; this does not certify cleanliness. Fingerprints and other molecular contamination may remain invisible. Select CONTINUE.
  - clip: {fileID: 8300000, guid: 22a5ebc88957241ac841cc83a0df0a3f, type: 3}
    text: Pass complete. Lifted correctly. Press the trigger to refold to a fresh face.
  - clip: {fileID: 8300000, guid: e7c5a504a89aa4905959527ea55fdc7d, type: 3}
    text: Pass complete. Lifted correctly. Press the trigger to flip to a fresh face.
  - clip: {fileID: 8300000, guid: 9dbae98cf453d48b2bfebfc8204b2f3c, type: 3}
    text: That face has already been used. Lift, then press the trigger for a fresh face.
  - clip: {fileID: 8300000, guid: c4beee7da770e435abb99fb64a3bb7e6, type: 3}
    text: Lift and start at the left edge of the next parallel pass.
  - clip: {fileID: 8300000, guid: d5c3663795a034d2983dd4aa507ce855, type: 3}
    text: Avoid scrubbing back and forth or crossing the passes. Lift and retry this pass from the left.
  - clip: {fileID: 8300000, guid: 6e05bd245fe2d40bbab5d12f70a344f8, type: 3}
    text: Now try a Class B plate independently. Inspect, choose a suitable wipe, then repeat the four-pass technique.
  - clip: {fileID: 8300000, guid: 16df6f75fec104cd2b0bfada06680e2b, type: 3}
    text: Rehearsal complete. You practised inspection, wipe selection, fresh faces and parallel passes. Follow the approved local procedure for real cleaning; ask trained staff about solvents, ultrasonic baths and baking.
  - clip: {fileID: 8300000, guid: b11edfcd161174958a0bc223482579d9, type: 3}
    text: Particles are visible in this demonstration. Choose the wipe suitable for Class A. Grip a wipe to pick it up.
  - clip: {fileID: 8300000, guid: b21f3fb074be94c7ea418c967cecbdcb, type: 3}
    text: Particles are visible in this demonstration. Choose the wipe suitable for Class B. Grip a wipe to pick it up.
  narrator: {fileID: 4628898695386231466}
